{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00167","headline":"平胡 · 明皇帝","name":"平胡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杂虏忽猖狂，无何敢乱常。\n羽书朝继入，烽火夜相望。\n将出凶门勇，兵因死地强。\n蒙轮皆突骑，按劒尽鹰扬。\n鼓角雄山野，龙蛇入战场。\n流膏润沙漠，溅血染锋鋩。\n雾扫清玄塞，云开静朔方。\n武功今已立，文德愧前王。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"明皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}